    "notes": "brace-expansion quadratic-time expansion. Only copy is node_modules/npm/node_modules/brace-expansion (5.0.9), inside the npm CLI's bundled tree via semantic-release > @semantic-release/npm > npm. Bundled deps are frozen in npm's published tarball and cannot be reached by `overrides`; npm 11.20.0 (the newest release allowed by min-release-age) and 12.2.0 both still bundle 5.0.9. Release-time tooling only, never reachable from compiler or runtime code. Remove once npm bundles brace-expansion >=5.0.12.",
